' F16 -- The citation gap.
' Chapter 6 (Evaluation). Concept diagram.
' Claim supported: verifiable source attribution is computed correctly on the
' server and consumed by no reachable user interface. Groundedness is real at
' the API boundary and invisible at the user boundary.
@startuml f16-citation-gap
!include _style.iuml

title The citation gap -- implemented server-side, invisible to users

rectangle "**SERVER -- works as designed**" as SRV {
  rectangle "LLM reply text\ncontains [Slide N] markers" as A
  rectangle "_extract_citations\ntutor.py:106-133" as B
  rectangle "Drop every index **not** in\nthe retrieved set\n//invented [Slide 99] discarded//" as C
  rectangle "Surviving citations carry\nreal similarity scores" as D
  A --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D
}

rectangle "ChatResponse.citations" as RESP #DCDCDC
D --> RESP

rectangle "**CLIENT -- three consumers**" as CLI {
  rectangle "LectureView.tsx\n//live student surface//" as E
  rectangle "InlineLecturePlayer.tsx\n//live student surface//" as F
  rectangle "LectureChat.tsx\nrenders clickable chips\nwith slide-jump" as G #F2F2F2
}

RESP --> E
RESP --> F
RESP --> G

rectangle "**Discarded.**\nChatMessage type has no\ncitations field; data.citations\nis never read." as E2 #BFBFBF
rectangle "**Substituted.**\nShows a hand-built label from the\n//currently visible// slide -- not\nfrom what the model cited." as F2 #BFBFBF
rectangle "**Unreachable.**\nImported nowhere. Only references\nare its own definition and its test.\nIts telemetry never fires." as G2 #BFBFBF

E --> E2
F --> F2
G --> G2

note bottom of CLI
  The 'grounded' boolean is not part of ChatResponse at all
  (ai_content.py:84-87), so the lecture tutor cannot signal
  ungroundedness to the UI even in principle. The refusal
  affordance exists only in CommandPalette, which sits behind
  FEATURE_GLOBAL_SEARCH -- off by default.
end note

legend bottom
  Net result: a normal student receives a retrieval-grounded, injection-hardened,
  prompt-constrained tutor answer with **zero visible source attribution and no
  refusal signal**. The gap between implemented and delivered is the finding.
endlegend

@enduml
